    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Spearhead-at-Arms",
    "summary": "When a friendly model uses a [Bondsman](vsdata:ability/imperial-knights.bondsman) ability, you may expand its selection to include zero to 3 friendly **ARMIGER** models. This applies only if no friendly model has used that same ability earlier in the turn. Choose models within 12″ of the user that are free of an existing [Bondsman](vsdata:ability/imperial-knights.bondsman) effect. An [Honoured](vsdata:ability/imperial-knights.code-chivalric) army instead uses a range of 15″. End the effect when your following [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins.",
